# The Shadower's third job node, and the one skill here with two forms. GMS
# calls them Eviscerate Fail and Eviscerate Success, which is the whole of the
# mechanism: one key, and what goes out is settled by whether an enemy is
# carrying a full wound rather than by the player.
#
# Pressed cold it summons hidden friends -- 675+27x% five times across ten
# enemies, on a 14 second wait. Landed on a wound at full depth the Shadower
# appears behind that one enemy and slashes five times for 825+33x% seven
# times, with the crit rate, the defence it ignores, the 1.8 seconds of
# invulnerability and the longer 20 second wait that GMS states for that clause
# alone.
#
# The wound is stated here because GMS hangs it off this skill's passive half:
# Assassinate and Sonic Blow leave one and say nothing about it, and neither
# leaves any until this node is bought. Assassinate's finishing blow leaves one
# stack and every attack of Sonic Blow leaves three, so a single Sonic Blow
# fills the wound and three Assassinates do. One enemy carries it at a time.
#
# Nothing here reads the wound for damage -- GMS's tooltip states no per-stack
# lift, and the wound is purely the key that opens the heavier form.
#
# Dropped: the 650 MP, the link windows off Assassinate and Sonic Blow (there
# is no key to press), and both forms' immunity to attack reflection.
name: "Trickblade"
description:
  "Summon your hidden friends to strike the enemies around you. Against an "
  "enemy wounded deeply enough, move behind it instead and cut it down."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_SHADOWER_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_DAGGER
base_delay_ms: 480
cooldown_seconds: 14.0
max_enemies: 10
lines: 5
base { skill_pct: 7.02 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.27 }
buff {
  needs_wound_form: true
  duration_seconds: 1.8
  base { damage_taken_pct: 1.00 }
}
wound {
  duration_seconds: 10.0
  max_stacks: 3
  source { skill_name: "Assassinate" stacks: 1 }
  source { skill_name: "Sonic Blow" stacks: 3 }
  form {
    label: "Trickblade Finish"
    max_enemies: 1
    lines: 7
    casts: 5
    base_delay_ms: 1200
    cooldown_seconds: 20.0
    base {
      skill_pct: 8.58
      crit_rate: 1.00
      ied_pct: 1.00
    }
    per_level { skill_pct: 0.33 }
  }
}
